/v1/","context":{"app_id":5015480,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1847286114039926","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"update","title":"Update #5 - Optimization","summary":"Hello, dear beekeepers !Today, we're releasing a great update focused on optimizing the game's resources!After several tests, you should see an average 3x increase in FPS !Yes, that much! There was still plenty of room for optimization. I'm also working on the future of the game, including revisiting the world building, but that will be coming in future updates.Enjoy the game! If you encounter any bugs or have any feedback to share, feel free to join the Discord server !💛","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T15:38:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039926","verified_at":"2026-10-24T18:49:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1847286114035386","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"update","title":"Update #4 - Fluffy Expansion","summary":"Greetings, dear beekeepers !A lovely new update is here! I hope you’ll enjoy it, and I can’t wait to hear your feedback !AdditionsAdded fluffy effects to make the gameplay experience more enjoyable :Tokens now pop out and float in the air.Honeycomb cells now feature a pop-up animation.Menus now feature pop-in and pop-out animations.Bees now tilt when turning and feature a pop-up animation.Flower beds now squash and stretch when being harvested and regenerating.Enemies now display their name and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:05:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035386","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1846651706689355","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"update","title":"Update #3","summary":"Hello, beekeepers !Today’s small patch fixes a few visual issues.WorldQuest exclamation marks (\"!\") now correctly tilt according to the camera’s rotation.BeesBees in Producer mode now correctly orient themselves inside the honeycomb cells when they have no pollen to process.When using a hive slot other than the default one, bees now correctly orient themselves relative to the honeycomb cells.I’m currently working on the game’s multiplayer mode ! You can find a few sneak peeks of what’s coming on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:01:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689355","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1846651706684316","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"update","title":"Update #2 - Shaders","summary":"Hello everyone !This update took some time to arrive, and the reason is simple : the engine I use to develop the game also received a major update, which broke several of my systems that I had to rewrite.The shadow and lighting systems have also been completely revamped. I was able to test these changes for a few days to find the best settings.So, here’s what’s changed !Settings MenuAdded :Shaders: added a new setting that allows you to enable or disable shaders.Language :In French, the key name","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:58:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1845383656395901","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"update","title":"Update #1","summary":"Before getting into the details of this patch, I wanted to thank you all for the launch of the demo!Yesterday, 330 of you downloaded the demo. I’ve already received several reports and suggestions, which led to this first patch note.Quality-of-Life ImprovementsYou can now scroll through the quest menu using the mouse wheel when no menu is open.If a menu is open, such as the Pause or Inventory menu, you need to point the cursor over the menu to scroll through it.Bug FixesLanguage detection on the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:13:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395901","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1845383656393784","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"announcement","title":"🐝 The Bees Are Ready to Serve You !","summary":"The Beehive Simulator demo is now available !You can now discover the world of Beehive Simulator and start building your very own bee colony.The goal of this demo is primarily to give you a first technical preview of the game and gather your feedback. You can share your thoughts directly through the Steam Community Hub, or through the Discord server, where it will be easier to discuss the game and exchange ideas.Of course, if you enjoy the demo, don't forget to add the game to your wishlist ! ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T15:25:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393784","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015480-1842212951313794","game_id":"steam-5015480","kind":"announcement","title":"🐝 The Bees Are Starting to Leave the Hive !","summary":"The development of Beehive Simulator is going well... really well, actually !The core gameplay loops are now complete, optimization is already underway, and the first closed beta sessions have started.After a lot of bug fixing and fine-tuning, the game is really starting to take shape.📈 Progression Is Taking ShapeThe game’s balance is now coming together nicely, and you can really start to feel the sense of progression.A huge number of bugs have also been fixed, bringing us closer and closer to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T15:24:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5015480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5015480":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5015480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z"},"5022270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:48Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5015480","app_id":5015480,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"67c59b17f4f3250ea7037a28544825130828a0e951230c682e0842cbf233edf1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build and expand the hive of your dreams 